    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0135","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Tenzin Rautenbach talks about a square that refuses to be a square. A curator joined for ten minutes and left convinced that the chair was part of the exhibition.</Description>
